{"type":"message","id":"eb515365","parentId":"cc875062","timestamp":"2026-03-21T01:57:24.794Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"019d0e1c73be4b05be7a6a498a9b2aa8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: self-improvement\ndescription: \"Captures learnings, errors, and corrections to enable continuous improvement. Use when: (1) A command or operation fails unexpectedly, (2) User corrects Claude ('No, that's wrong...', 'Actually...'), (3) User requests a capability that doesn't exist, (4) An external API or tool fails, (5) Claude realizes its knowledge is outdated or incorrect, (6) A better approach is discovered for a recurring task. Also review learnings before major tasks.\"\nmetadata:\n---\n\n# Self-Improvement Skill\n\nLog learnings and errors to markdown files for continuous improvement. Coding agents can later process these into fixes, and important learnings get promoted to project memory.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Command/operation fails | Log to `.learnings/ERRORS.md` |\n| User corrects you | Log to `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` with category `correction` |\n| User wants missing feature | Log to `.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md` |\n| API/external tool fails | Log to `.learnings/ERRORS.md` with integration details |\n| Knowledge was outdated | Log to `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` with category `knowledge_gap` |\n| Found better approach | Log to `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` with category `best_practice` |\n| Simplify/Harden recurring patterns | Log/update `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` with `Source: simplify-and-harden` and a stable `Pattern-Key` |\n| Similar to existing entry | Link with `**See Also**`, consider priority bump |\n| Broadly applicable learning | Promote to `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and/or `.github/copilot-instructions.md` |\n| Workflow improvements | Promote to `AGENTS.md` (OpenClaw workspace) |\n| Tool gotchas | Promote to `TOOLS.md` (OpenClaw workspace) |\n| Behavioral patterns | Promote to `SOUL.md` (OpenClaw workspace) |\n\n## OpenClaw Setup (Recommended)\n\nOpenClaw is the primary platform for this skill. It uses workspace-based prompt injection with automatic skill loading.\n\n### Installation\n\n**Via ClawdHub (recommended):**\n```bash\nclawdhub install self-improving-agent\n```\n\n**Manual:**\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/peterskoett/self-improving-agent.git ~/.openclaw/skills/self-improving-agent\n```\n\nRemade for openclaw from original repo : https://github.com/pskoett/pskoett-ai-skills - https://github.com/pskoett/pskoett-ai-skills/tree/main/skills/self-improvement\n\n### Workspace Structure\n\nOpenClaw injects these files into every session:\n\n```\n\n[598 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774058244788}}
{"type":"message","id":"70cb3248","parentId":"eb515365","timestamp":"2026-03-21T01:57:24.806Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"019d0e1c7f464217321dbc62fb0ed764","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: fanzong-self-improving-agent\ndescription: \"中文优先的自我改进与经验沉淀技能。用于 OpenClaw 工作流中的错误记录、用户纠正记录、能力缺口记录、重复踩坑归档，以及 Bug Hunting / issue 提交前的经验复盘。适用于：(1) 命令、工具、外部 API 调用失败，(2) 用户明确纠正，(3) 发现更稳妥的固定做法，(4) 暴露出缺失能力或待建设流程，(5) 准备做重要任务前回顾历史踩坑。\"\n---\n\n# Fanzong Self-Improving Agent\n\n把 `.learnings/` 当作**暂存层**，不是长期记忆层。\n\n## 核心规则\n\n- 只记录**高价值**内容，拒绝流水账\n- 中文优先，写短句，结论先行\n- 不自动把 `.learnings/` 晋升到 `SOUL.md`、`AGENTS.md`、`TOOLS.md`、`MEMORY.md`\n- 只有“重复出现 + 已验证 + 可复用”的经验，才允许晋升\n- 不写入密钥、token、私人代码、敏感日志、未发布内容\n- 默认手动记录，默认不开 hook\n\n## 何时使用\n\n### 1. 记入 `.learnings/ERRORS.md`\n用于：\n- `exec` / `process` / `browser` / `message` / `sessions_*` 等工具调用失败\n- 外部 API 报错\n- 文档步骤走不通\n- 实际行为与文档明显不一致\n- 同类问题重复出现\n\n### 2. 记入 `.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`\n用于：\n- 用户明确纠正\n- 发现更优且可复用的工作方法\n- 识别出稳定的 Bug Hunting / 排障套路\n- 确认某个技能、工具、命令在当前环境下的可靠做法\n\n### 3. 记入 `.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n用于：\n- 用户提出当前不具备的新能力\n- 值得后续沉淀成 skill / script / workflow 的需求\n\n## 不该记录的内容\n\n- 一次性小失误且没有复用价值\n- 未经验证的猜测\n- 情绪化抱怨\n- 只是“这次没做好”，但没有提炼出原因和对策\n- 任何敏感信息\n\n## 记录格式要求\n\n\n[58 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774058244800}}
{"type":"message","id":"7232761e","parentId":"70cb3248","timestamp":"2026-03-21T01:57:36.581Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好，我现在理解了这两个技能。让我对比一下：\n\n**self-improvement**（英文版）：\n- 记录到 `.learnings/ERRORS.md`、`.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`、`.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n- 会自动把重要经验晋升到 `CLAUDE.md`、`AGENTS.md`、`.github/copilot-instructions.md`\n- 对 OpenClaw 是晋升到 `SOUL.md`、`AGENTS.md`、`TOOLS.md`\n- 默认由系统自动触发 hook\n\n**fanzong-self-improving-agent**（中文版）：\n- 也是记录到 `.learnings/ERRORS.md`、`.learnings/LEARNINGS.md`、`.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md`\n- 强调中文优先\n- **不自动**把 `.learnings/` 晋升到 `SOUL.md` 等文件\n- 只有\"重复出现 + 已验证 + 可复用\"的经验才允许晋升\n- 默认手动记录，默认不开 hook\n\n这两个技能确实有**功能重叠**，但不完全冲突，主要区别：\n\n1. **记录位置相同**：都是写到 `.learnings/` 目录\n2. **晋升策略不同**：\n   - self-improvement：自动晋升重要内容到更高层\n   - fanzong-self-improving-agent：默认不晋升，手动且严格筛选\n3. **触发方式**：\n   - self-improvement 可能支持 hook 自动触发\n   - fanzong-self-improving-agent 默认手动，需要时才调用\n\n潜在的冲突点是两者同时启用可能导致重复记录。我应该给用户一个清晰的对比和建议。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n不完全冲突，但**功能重叠**，建议精简。\n\n## 🔍 对比分析\n\n| 维度 | self-improvement | fanzong-self-improving-agent |\n|------|------------------|------------------------------|\n| **语言** | English | 中文优先 |\n| **记录位置** | `.learnings/` | `.learnings/` |\n| **晋升策略** | 自动晋升到 SOUL/AGENTS/TOOLS | 默认不晋升，严格筛选才晋升 |\n| **触发方式** | 可能支持 hook 自动触发 | 默认手动，默认不开 hook |\n| **定位** | 通用型自我改进 | 中文场景 + 严格筛选 |\n\n## ⚠️ 潜在问题\n\n1. **重复记录**：两者写入同一文件，可能重复\n2. **晋升冲突**：如果同时启用，可能出现一个要晋升、一个不让晋升的矛盾\n3. **风格冲突**：一个偏激进（啥都记、都晋升），一个偏保守（只记高价值）\n\n## 💡 建议\n\n**二选一**，或让 fanzong 替代 self-improvement：\n\n- 如果你偏好**严格筛选 + 中文优先** → 保留 `fanzong-self-improving-agent`，删除另一个\n- 如果你习惯**自动晋升 + English** → 保留 `self-improvement`\n\n要我去掉其中一个吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":1253,"output":922,"cacheRead":22016,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24191,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774058244804}}
