{"type":"message","id":"a85b14db","parentId":"dd981a36","timestamp":"2026-03-21T03:30:32.915Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"找到了！在 a2aProtocol.js 中：\n\n```javascript\n_heartbeatIntervalMs = intervalMs || Number(process.env.HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_MS) || 360000; // default 6min\n```\n\n默认是 360000 毫秒 = 6 分钟。\n\n可以通过环境变量 `HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_MS` 自定义。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**是的，是 skill 的默认值。**\n\n源码 `src/gep/a2aProtocol.js`：\n```javascript\n_heartbeatIntervalMs = intervalMs || Number(process.env.HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_MS) || 360000; // default 6min\n```\n\n- **默认**: 360000ms = **6 分钟**\n- **可配置**: 通过环境变量 `HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_MS` 调整\n\n例如改成 3 分钟：\n```bash\nHEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_MS=180000 node index.js run --loop\n```\n\n要改吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":662,"output":261,"cacheRead":43904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44827,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774063827528}}
