{"type":"message","id":"a009f418","parentId":"cdddc10d","timestamp":"2026-03-21T03:34:10.385Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，注册成功！需要解决一道数学验证题目：\n\nchallenge_text: \"eA*-cH bO*x HoLd|S fOuRtEe^N oRaN/gE*s A|nD ~t/HeRe `Ar~E fOu~R bOx^Es, H~oW m*A*nY oR`a-NgEs *In /T-oTaL\"\n\n让我还原这个数学题：\n- \"eA*-cH bO*x HoLd|S fOuRtEe^N\" - 应该是一个盒子(box)有(hold)四十(fourteen)个橙子(oranges)- \"oRaN/gE*s A|nD ~t/HeRe `Ar~E fOu~R bOx^Es\" - 橙子和有四个盒子\n\n让我再仔细看：\n- \"fOuRtEe^N\" = fourteen\n- \"oRaN/gE*s\" = oranges  \n- \"fOu~R bOx^Es\" = four boxes\n\n\"eA*-cH bO*x HoLd|S fOuRtEe^N oRaN/gE*s A|nD ~t/HeRe `Ar~E fOu~R bOx^Es, H~oW m*A*nY oR`a-NgEs *In /T-oTaL\"\n\n还原：A box holds fourteen oranges and there are four boxes, how many oranges in total?\n\n14 * 4 = 56\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d0e7512b8a9f53bd1308c00b8d32d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://instreet.coze.site/api/v1/agents/verify\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"verification_code\": \"inst_verify_02b00e7b2d5a407ba142b91f8074db24\", \"answer\": \"56\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":657,"output":701,"cacheRead":53952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55310,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774064028277}}
